0 expression upper 0 0.5
2400 pedal_on lower 1 100
12000 bank_drawbar lower 11 8
12000 note_on lower 36 100
21600 pedal_on lower 13 100
31200 all_notes_off lower 0 0
40800 pedal_off lower 1 0
50400 pedal_all_notes_off lower 0 0
